//! The market-data methods and builders of [`MarketDataClient`].
//!
//! The endpoint table expands here: list endpoints into plain methods
//! returning `Vec<String>` through [`list_endpoint!`], every other endpoint
//! into a builder that parses the response into typed ticks through
//! [`parsed_endpoint!`]. The streaming builders that pump a gRPC server
//! stream through a user callback are still generated by the build script
//! (`mdds_streaming_endpoints_generated.rs`).

